What is a Data Annotation Tool?
Data annotation tools are purpose built applications that empower data scientists, domain experts and annotators to add meaningful metadata to raw datasets. By attaching labels such as object boundaries, sentiment categories, speech transcripts or 3 D bounding boxes, these platforms enable supervised learning algorithms to recognize patterns, make predictions and ultimately deliver business value. Modern solutions combine intuitive user interfaces with AI assisted pre labeling, active learning loops and rigorous audit trails, ensuring that the resulting training data meets both performance and compliance requirements.
